sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: The flow of one search request
  accDescr: The page fetches the results without an explanation and shows them at once; the explanation is fetched separately after the results and is built from a template when no model is available.
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant W as Web (Next.js)
  participant A as API
  participant L as Model gateway
  U->>W: /search?q=...
  W->>A: POST /search (explain=false)
  A->>L: Query understanding (cached)
  L-->>A: SearchIntent
  A->>A: Guards, dates, filters, prices, rank, villa grouping
  A-->>W: Results with reasons and sources
  W-->>U: Results (no wait for the explanation)
  W->>A: POST /search/explanation
  A->>L: Text around the slots
  alt Model answered and passed the verifier
    L-->>A: Text with {F1}...
    A-->>W: Model explanation
  else Model unavailable or rejected
    A-->>W: Template built by code
  end
  W-->>U: "Why the first option?"
